      <stem>랜덤변수 $X$의 확률밀도함수(Probability Density Function)가 $f_{X} ( x ) = e^{- x} ( x \geq 0 )$일 때, 옳지 않은 것은?</stem>
      <formulas count="7">
        <formula area="질문">X</formula>
        <formula area="질문">f_{X} ( x ) = e^{- x} ( x \geq 0 )</formula>
        <formula area="선택지③">X</formula>
        <formula area="선택지③">e^{- 1}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">Y = \sqrt{X}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">Y</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">{f}_{Y} ( y ) = 2 e^{- y^{2}} ( y \geq 0 )</formula>
      </formulas>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="false">평균은 1이다.</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="false">표준편차는 1이다.</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="false">$X$가 1보다 클 확률은 $e^{- 1}$이다.</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="true">$Y = \sqrt{X}$일 때, $Y$의 확률밀도함수 ${f}_{Y} ( y ) = 2 e^{- y^{2}} ( y \geq 0 )$이다.</choice>
